    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But it's not a gift, Kaelen. It's a sentence. I'm just waiting for a relief that never comes. You're my friend, you've seen everything I've lost... looking at me now, do you really think I have anything left to give? Or is it just a mercy to let someone who has nothing finally rest?",
